      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_trailing_bytes_cleanup_must_clear_sess",
      "fine_trace_step": 6,
      "description": "Root cause. On the trailing-bytes consistency-failure path, `tls_decrypt_ticket()` frees `sess` but does not clear the local pointer before the shared epilogue publishes it through `*psess`, so the caller receives a dangling non-NULL `SSL_SESSION *`."
    },
    {
      "invariant_id": "n_ssl_version_read_uses_published_session",
